{"server":"cn","storyId":"act12side_level_act12side_01_beg","groupId":"act12side","stageId":"act12side_01","title":"意外入选","storyCode":"DH-1","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"35c5dfa9f61125306100808062092b0f379aa7d73fd3a14660fae094e48d0941","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（人感觉和汐斯塔一样多，不过氛围上完全不一样。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（到处都是酒吧、赌场、餐厅......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"轻浮的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"美女，要不要和我们一起去沙滩边玩啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"滚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（林雨霞一大早人就不见了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......我准备再给那只下水道老鼠打个电话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我没怎么来过这里，但我觉得特殊部队一定在做可怕的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你见过贫民区的林吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我见过。是个很和善的老人，比我爷爷好多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......他可是“鼠王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"这几个人不都这样。但他真的是个好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是没想到雨霞她会变成现在这个样子。明明以前是个又胆小又腼腆的孩子，经常躲在你背后来着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒觉得她没有变。她只是......担负起了责任。也许并不该属于她的责任。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（算了，反正她跑不了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，来都来了，找点事做吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（做点什么呢......买土特产？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（星熊和诗怀雅她们......买回去还要寄，有点麻烦，等她们什么时候过来外勤给她们好了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（对了，也要给文月夫人准备一份谢礼。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（罗德岛的话......白雪，风笛，阿米娅，还有......她？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（算了。总之，人有点多，不知道能不能带得过来，看情况再说吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（不过感觉也要不了多少时间......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（到处走走？......反正干什么都要到处走的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（让那个埃内斯托带我参观一下城市的景点？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（......算了，不熟。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（对了，坎黛拉市长说的那件事......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近这段日子里，城里的武器流通变得有些异常频繁，如果你们玩乐之余觉得有些不够刺激，那么，你们不妨试试调查着玩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（这个人明明是市长，却一点也不关心自己的城市，魏彦吾怎么会结交这样的人？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（而且这座城市，完全是纸醉金迷、骄奢淫逸的代名词......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（......诗怀雅说不定会喜欢这种地方，我宁愿回汐斯塔。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（唉，算了，来都来了，查案总比没事干强，还是查查看吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（虽然坎黛拉市长说查案的事也可以问埃内斯托，不过如果他们有明确的线索的话肯定早就行动了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（直接去问大概是问不出什么的，还是先到处走走，从了解城市开始吧。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懊恼的男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"昨晚战况怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高兴的男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"赢了几千，你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懊恼的男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，我输惨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高兴的男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，没事，今天赢回来不就完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懊恼的男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"不用你说我也这么打算，*玻利瓦尔感叹词*，还是这里爽，我根本不想回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高兴的男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"谁不是呢，一回到外面就又要看打打杀杀的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高兴的男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜啊，咱们没钱在这买套房子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懊恼的男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"赌赢不就有了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高兴的男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，有道理！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的酒吧招待","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这位美丽的小姐，有兴趣来我们酒吧工作吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的酒吧招待","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"像你这么漂亮的人，一晚上就能赚大钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"滚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"赌场、酒吧、餐厅、卡拉OK，这座城市里除了这些就没有别的了吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......距离海选结束，还有两天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈转过头去，发现声音是从路边商店橱窗中摆放的电视机中传来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视台主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位市民们，游客们，有在好好享受你们的假期吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视台主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我昨天在赌场输了三十万，今天可是打算去赢回来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视台主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那么，在经过为期十天的角逐后，多索雷斯极限大奖赛的海选将在今天结束！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视台主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而午后三点，也就是三个小时之后，我们将迎来海选中最后一场的大乱斗海选赛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视台主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是热爱大奖赛的你绝对不能错过的一场比赛！千万不要忘记前往比赛现场享受刺激的氛围！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视台主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然，不想忍受炎炎夏日和拥挤的人群也不用着急，锁定我们的官方电视台，我们会准点为你直播赛事内容！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视台主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"对了，这里还有一条说不定会让音乐爱好者们非常兴奋的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视台主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，可能你们已经听到了消息，坎黛拉市长居然请来了塞壬唱片旗下的知名音乐人，D.D.D.。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视台主持人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且，这位蒙面示人的音乐人，不仅将为我们带来她那奔放的电子乐，还将担任本次大奖赛的特邀主持！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急躁的男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"妮娜，快点，你没听到吗，还有一个小时比赛就开始了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懒散的女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"打架有什么好看的，太野蛮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急躁的男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"混战海选出线的人都是比赛的黑马，不注意一下可不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懒散的女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"那你去看吧，看完记得告诉我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"急躁的男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"你这女人......啧，算了，自己去就自己去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热爱音乐的男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，真的假的，我前几天就听说D.D.D.来了，没想到是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热爱音乐的女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得她上个月好像还在汐斯塔，居然现在就到多索雷斯来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热爱音乐的女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"而且居然能请动她来当主持，坎黛拉市长究竟是怎么说服她的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热爱音乐的男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热爱音乐的女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_202","isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道？现在不少人都在猜，D.D.D.很有可能是一名女性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热爱音乐的男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_201","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......我是觉得是男是女都无所谓，反正我们有耳福了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈意识到，几乎所有人都在谈论着比赛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（这场比赛，看来确实受到这座城市里大部分人的关注。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（......要想在比赛之中搞事情，对方肯定不会放过作为参赛选手混入其中，伺机制造混乱的机会。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"（既然如此......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"喂，是陈小姐吗？哈哈，抱歉，我这边现在稍微有些不方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"喝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"手机那边传来的声音","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"嘎啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你在和人战斗？发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"这就有些说来话长了，简单来说，林小姐和人打起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你现在在哪里？我来找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"好，我在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"narration","text":"三小时前"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么要帮他？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"幼稚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"林小姐，需要我帮忙吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"你说过，你对这座城市很熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"背景独立的小赌场，有没有办法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"背景独立......您是想要惹事了不会有什么大问题的那种？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"这样的话您不用担心，有坎黛拉女士在，谁都不敢找您的麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我想要的是，收拾起来不麻烦的那种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，这是一家酒吧赌场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板阿拉斯白手起家，靠着一股狠劲硬生生在这条街上把这家店开到这么大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"周围几条街的势力都很想要他这家店，不过谁都啃不下他这块硬骨头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在这里等着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赌场喽啰","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"请问您是要喝酒还是玩两把？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玩两把。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赌场喽啰","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好厉害的女人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赌场喽啰","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"快，快去把老板叫过来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赌场老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，我不管你是谁，但你太狂妄了，一个人来这样的地方闹事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说废话。开牌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赌场老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"四条。呵呵呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同花顺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赌场老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你藏牌的手法太差了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赌场老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，我承认你可能确实有些本事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把你们的武器都掏出来吧，我赶时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赌场老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，小的们，上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G02"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然事先有做过调查......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，这就是龙门鼠王之女的做法吗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"林雨霞呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈小姐，您来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那帮人打不过林小姐就跑了，林小姐追去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"往哪个方向？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃内斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那边，沙滩方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，我去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑得还挺快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"林雨霞，你在搞什么东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈晖洁？你来干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"是我在问你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赌场老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，哪来的神经病，打不过，还甩不掉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赌场喽啰","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，我们怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赌场老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"还能怎么办，跑啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赌场老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赌场老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"那边是......混战海选会场？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赌场老板","speakerId":"avg_npc_207","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，正好。我们混进去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speaker